# Class: pmd:PMD_0020267 (mass per count)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label pmd:PMD_0020267 "mass per count"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition pmd:PMD_0020267 "a relational quality expressing a mass of a part in relation to the the count of the whole"@en)
